  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Extra Finance is primarily a DeFi lending and leveraged yield farming protocol deployed on Optimism and Base. It enables users to lend assets and use leverage in yield farming strategies. Berachain/Bera contracts should be treated as an additional deployment with negligible current TVL unless documentation supports otherwise; any vault products should be described as related or curated vaults rather than the primary native protocol architecture.",
    "relationship_narrative": "The LendingPool supplies liquidity for leveraged farming positions managed by BeraPositionManager and deployed via BeraFarmingVaultFactory. EXTRA token and VeToken govern the protocol through GnosisSafe multisigs, while vaults operate independently to optimize yields.",
